$DATUM Cha, Jin Soon; Moon, Suk Joung; Park, Jae Hyung
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2001), 66(22), 7514-7515

