$DATUM Ng, Stephanie M.; Bader, Scott J.; Snapper, Marc L.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2006), 128(22), 7315-7319

